<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grootvlei Q1 net pre-capex slides into loss.</title>
<headline>Grootvlei Q1 net pre-capex slides into loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  (1.50) vs 2.03</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   4.76  vs 6.16</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			    577  vs 618</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			   107,000  vs 119,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.39  vs 5.19</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			   56,423  vs 52,469</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			51,854  vs 56,142</p>
<p>Full name: The Grootvlei Proprietary Mines Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is committed to net expenditure of 3.2 million rand (previous quarter: 4.2 million rand.)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
